# 10. REDUCED MOTION & ACCESSIBILITY

Respect:

`prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`

When this preference is active:

- Disable entrance translations.
- Disable unnecessary stagger delays.
- Disable image-scale animations.
- Make page content immediately visible.
- Preserve all existing interactions.
- Preserve focus behavior.

Do not use animation to communicate information that cannot otherwise be understood.

Ensure keyboard-focused elements are never visually hidden because an animation has not completed.

If a user tabs to an unrevealed section, ensure it becomes visible immediately.

The implementation must support Arabic RTL and English LTR without hardcoded directional offsets.

Use logical properties or direction-independent transforms.

